---
description: Guidelines for good code
globs: *.tsx, *.ts, *.js
---

# Structure

- app/_layout.txt (entry point)
- app/(tabs) (tabs)
- componenets/ (reusable ui components)
- constants/ (enums, consts)
- hooks/ (reusable hooks)
- store/ (redux store)

# Stack

- always use expo alternatives if available
- use modern react 
- use redux for state, never context

# General

- keep code DRY
- avoid unecessary abstractions
- keep code simple
- focus on code that is easy to read
- do not add unecessary comments
- do not create new high level directories except for those available in Structure

# React

- do not use inline styles
- use functional componenets
- do not use console logging
